    0.2.4-dev - 2026/05/09 (dd2fd98) [develop]
        :brief 新增 OpenAI-compatible Provider/Model 角色向导基础
        :changes
        - feat(models): 新增 ProviderEndpointConfig 与 OpenAI-compatible /models discovery, 支持 base_url、api_key、compatibility、timeout diagnostics
        - feat(secrets): provider public config 写入 ~/.papercode/providers, API key 仅写入 ~/.papercode/local/provider-secrets.json
        - feat(roles): 新增 ModelRoleAssignment, 支持 default、per-role、subagent override 解析
        - feat(api): /paper/providers/discover 支持用户端点 POST discovery, /paper/model-roles 支持 assignment resolve
        - feat(tui): 新增 Paper model roles dialog command, TUI 可查看当前角色模型解析
        - docs(readme): 版本更新为 0.2.4-dev, 记录 provider discovery 与 secret-safe model config
        - test(models): 覆盖 /models discovery、API key 不泄漏、secret-safe storage 与 role/subagent override
